{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792295280, "covers_from": "2026-10-18T03:48:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-18T03:49:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792295340, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-18T03:48:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 29869, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "搭乘公車，常遇到司機 行進中常常即踩或即剎車，還因此跌坐在車上", "display_name": "文山代表 No.29,869", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-18T03:48:11+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 6180, "sprite_key": "bear_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "其他", "content": "我不是台北市民。但我支持沈伯洋！願您帶領台北市、帶動整個台灣越來越好！", "display_name": "大安代表 🌊zeena", "mood": "positive", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-18T03:48:22+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 8799, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "交通", "content": "想詢問對於未來雙北捷運路線網的擴充，PUMA的想法", "display_name": "信義代表 No.8,799", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-18T03:48:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 43477, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "觀光", "content": "台北有便利的交通跟歷史古蹟，更有豐富的自然生態，不需嚮往著雙城論壇而應該好好讓全世界看見台北看見台灣", "display_name": "北投代表 No.43,477", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-18T03:48:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 38623, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "交通", "content": "我住基隆，通勤上班，遇到國一車禍30分鐘車程變成2個小時，上班就遲到，想要意外通勤假！", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.38,623", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 6180, "sprite_key": "bear_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 🌊zeena", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 8799, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "display_name": "信義代表 No.8,799", "district": "xinyi", "is_replay": true, "frozen"